                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted fst-italic flex-grow-1 mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            "An otherworldly sanctuary. The attention to detail from the private butler to the culinary creations exceeded every luxury standard we have experienced worldwide."
                        </p>
                        <div class="border-top pt-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                            <div class="rounded-circle text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background-color: #172A28; font-weight: bold;">
                                LH
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Lord &amp; Lady Harrington</h4>
                                <small class="text-muted">London, United Kingdom • Stayed Penthouse</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-3 border h-100 d-flex flex-column shadow-sm">
                        <div class="mb-3" style="color: #C5A46D; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted fst-italic flex-grow-1 mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            "The overwater pool villa offered absolute serenity. Waking up to unobstructed sunrises and dining under the stars was pure magic. We will return every winter."
                        </p>
                        <div class="border-top pt-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                            <div class="rounded-circle text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background-color: #C5A46D; font-weight: bold;">
                                SV
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Sophia &amp; Marcus Vance</h4>
                                <small class="text-muted">Geneva, Switzerland • Stayed Pool Villa</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-3 border h-100 d-flex flex-column shadow-sm">
                        <div class="mb-3" style="color: #C5A46D; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted fst-italic flex-grow-1 mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            "Undoubtedly one of the finest resorts on the planet. Seamless helipad transfers, Michelin-level degustation, and flawless discretion throughout our holiday."
                        </p>
                        <div class="border-top pt-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                            <div class="rounded-circle text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background-color: #172A28; font-weight: bold;">
                                AC
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Alexander Chen</h4>
                                <small class="text-muted">Singapore • Executive Residence</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>
</odoo>
